# CarePoint SaaS-Level Upgrade Plan

This plan outlines the transformation of the existing CarePoint MERN app into a high-end, SaaS-level healthcare platform with AI capabilities, real-time chat, and premium aesthetics.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **AI API**: We will use Gemini API for the AI Symptom Checker. I will need you to provide a `GEMINI_API_KEY` in the `.env` file later.
> - **Real-Time Communication**: We will implement Socket.io. This will require a separate server or an integrated setup in `server.js`.
> - **Email**: For notifications, we'll use Nodemailer with Gmail (or a custom SMTP). You'll need to provide `EMAIL_USER` and `EMAIL_PASS`.

